~ potions
mister_crossroads [smile]: From the bottles that glow, friend. Three copper a bottle, and I never overcharge.
* [if not flag.ware_lilypad_tonic] Lilypad Tonic -> take_lilypad_tonic
* [if not flag.ware_jinxed_rum] Jinxed Rum -> take_jinxed_rum
* [if not flag.ware_silence_of_the_drowned] Silence of the Drowned -> take_silence_of_the_drowned
* [if not flag.ware_elixir_of_fogwalking] Elixir of Fogwalking -> take_elixir_of_fogwalking
* [if not flag.ware_harvest_brew] Harvest Brew -> take_harvest_brew
* [if not flag.ware_nightwatcher_potion] Nightwatcher Potion -> take_nightwatcher_potion
* [if not flag.ware_sight_of_sin] Sight of Sin -> take_sight_of_sin
* [if not flag.ware_tincture_of_mourning] Tincture of Mourning -> take_tincture_of_mourning
* [if not flag.ware_wytchwood_sap] Wytchwood Sap -> take_wytchwood_sap
* [if not flag.ware_nectar_of_the_green_man] Nectar of the Green Man -> take_nectar_of_the_green_man
* [if not flag.ware_draught_of_the_red_hunger] Draught of the Red Hunger -> take_draught_of_the_red_hunger
* [if not flag.ware_haint_hooch] Haint Hooch -> take_haint_hooch
* Look at something else -> wares

~ take_lilypad_tonic
Narrator: A paper tag reads 3 CP. A green, cloudy tonic that lets you stand on water for a minute, bobbing like a pad on a pond.
Narrator: The small print: the tag says only what the bottle does; the rest is between you and the bottle.
mister_crossroads [smile]: Wrapped, and on the house, practically.
give lilypad_tonic
if not flag.ware_lilypad_tonic and not flag.small_print_read
set deal_taken_blind
endif
set ware_lilypad_tonic
set sinner_deals += 1
-> wares

