~ curios
mister_crossroads [sly]: Curios, idols, a bag. Some of them are old friends of mine.
* [if not flag.ware_the_bag] The Bag -> take_the_bag
* [if not flag.ware_green_ribbon] Green ribbon -> take_green_ribbon
* [if not flag.ware_amber_birdcage] The Amber Birdcage -> take_amber_birdcage
* Look at something else -> wares

